  "name": "BBMRI-ERIC Negotiator",
  "alternateName": [
    "Negotiator"
  ],
  "description": "Open-source access negotiation platform for biobank and research infrastructure data requests. Manages the full Data Access Request (DAR) lifecycle — submission, review, multi-party negotiation, and approval — across distributed biobank networks. Used as the official access management system for BBMRI-ERIC, the pan-European biobank research infrastructure spanning 20+ countries. Deployable by individual biobanks or federated research networks.",
