  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The official data access negotiation platform for BBMRI-ERIC, the pan-European biobank network (20+ countries). Covers the full Data Access Request lifecycle including multi-party review and approval workflows — a genuine gap not addressed by generic workflow tools. AGPL-3.0 licence and Java stack may require evaluation for hospital IT environments. 33 stars understates institutional deployment; 11 forks indicate real infrastructure adoption. Assess for teams building FAIR data access workflows for biobanks or multi-site research networks; strong fit for ELIXIR and BBMRI-affiliated institutions.",
